Verified
✅ Build succeeds
✅ Tomcat starts on port 8443 (https) with the keystore
✅ Endpoints respond over HTTPS (https://localhost:8443/inventory/health)
✅ Plain HTTP to the TLS port is rejected (400 Bad Request)
Important caveats
Self-signed cert — fine for local/dev, but clients must skip verification (curl -k). For production, use a CA-issued certificate.
Hardcoded password (changeit) — for anything beyond dev, externalize it via an env var, e.g. key-store-password: ${SSL_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD}.
The port changed from the default 8080 → 8443. Update any clients/tests that assume http://localhost:8080.